From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Gazelka <andrew.gazelka@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Jul 2026 21:09:59 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] build: keep -Demit-lib-vt buildable without Apple
 absolute-path tools

The Nix darwin sandbox denies exec of host binaries at absolute paths,
and -Demit-lib-vt=true is the one ghostty subtree index builds fully
sandboxed (lib/build/libghostty-vt.nix documents the boundary). Two
upstream changes since the previous pin broke that:

- the vt static lib now vendors SIMD deps (simdutf, highway, utfcpp),
  so combineArchives runs LibtoolStep.normalizeArchive, which shelled
  to hardcoded /bin/cp and /usr/bin/ranlib. Resolve both from PATH so
  a sandboxed build can supply cctools; developer Macs still find the
  same Apple tools through the default PATH.

- build.zig hung the vt xcframework (macOS-universal lipo + iOS slices
  + xcodebuild) off the install step for every darwin build. Gate it on
  emit-xcframework, which already defaults false under -Demit-lib-vt,
  matching how the app xcframework is gated; xcodebuild has no sandbox
  substitute.

Refs indexable-inc/ix#8117
(patch authored by an AI agent via Claude Code, model Fable 5)

diff --git a/build.zig b/build.zig
index b89958e55..974c3c8af 100644
--- a/build.zig
+++ b/build.zig
@@ -154,8 +154,13 @@ pub fn build(b: *std.Build) !void {
 
     // libghostty-vt xcframework (Apple only, universal binary).
     // Only when building on macOS (not cross-compiling) since
-    // xcodebuild is required.
-    if (builtin.os.tag.isDarwin() and config.target.result.os.tag.isDarwin()) {
+    // xcodebuild is required. Gated on emit-xcframework (default false
+    // under -Demit-lib-vt) so a plain lib-vt build does not require
+    // xcodebuild or per-platform SDK slices.
+    if (builtin.os.tag.isDarwin() and
+        config.target.result.os.tag.isDarwin() and
+        config.emit_xcframework)
+    {
         const apple_libs = try buildpkg.GhosttyLibVt.initStaticAppleUniversal(
             b,
             &config,
diff --git a/src/build/LibtoolStep.zig b/src/build/LibtoolStep.zig
index 856a33aa8..b7f0a5819 100644
--- a/src/build/LibtoolStep.zig
+++ b/src/build/LibtoolStep.zig
@@ -70,7 +70,7 @@ fn normalizeArchive(
     run_step.addArgs(&.{
         "/bin/sh",
         "-c",
-        "/bin/cp \"$1\" \"$2\" && /usr/bin/ranlib \"$2\"",
+        "cp \"$1\" \"$2\" && ranlib \"$2\"",
         "_",
     });
     run_step.addFileArg(source);
